{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8b17a9b5-bc52-885e-b70d-dfcb208c39de",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T15:32:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:28:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:28:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Bridget Flynn here. I've got a landlord question about trash. I've got an old refrigerator that a tenant left behind and I need to get it hauled out. Does the city pick those up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, an old refrigerator. Is it sitting at a rental property of yours here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:29:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 61 Memorial Boulevard, over on the Easton's Beach side. It's on the side of the house by the barrels right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:29:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "61 Memorial Boulevard. Got it. So, large appliances like that usually are not just tossed in with the regular trash. They tend to need a special pickup arrangement, and if it has a cooling system, it has to be handled properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it's got the coolant and all that. It's a real old one. Wicked heavy too. I tried to slide it and I'm pretty sure it slid back at me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, I'm writing this down. So it's a refrigerator, curbside, you'd want it scheduled for a bulky item pickup. Is the door still on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:29:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Door's on. Tenant taped it shut, which I guess is something. Hang on, I dropped a coin, one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:29:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about that. I do magic as a hobby, amateur stuff, birthday parties, the odd family thing, and I've always got a coin on me. Well, I had one. It just rolled under the car seat. I'm in the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, I hope it turns up. So, door on and taped. Good. I'll note that for the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Found it, actually. Okay, so how do I set up the pickup? Is it a phone thing, or is there a form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put the request in from here. I just need to confirm the address, 61 Memorial Boulevard, the item is one refrigerator, and a good callback number for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191. And that's a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, cell. If I don't pick up, leave a message. I'm on and off ladders all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Now, the crew will tell you the day it's scheduled, and you'd put it at the curb that morning, not the night before, if you can help it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the other thing is, the tenant also left the recycling bin cracked. The lid is split right in half. How do I ask for a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same office handles that. Is it the blue recycling bin or the trash barrel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:31:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The recycling one. The blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the blue recycling bin with a cracked lid at 61 Memorial Boulevard. I'll put in a replacement request along with the refrigerator. It can take a little while to get delivered, so keep using what you have in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Do I need to be there when they drop it off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:31:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, they usually just leave it at the curb. Let me read it back. One old refrigerator, door taped shut, for bulky pickup, and one replacement blue recycling bin, both at 61 Memorial Boulevard, callback 401-555-0191, Bridget Flynn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:32:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:32:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:32:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that covers it. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Bridget. Have a good afternoon, and good luck with the coin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T15:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
